        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Typical SMM behaviour at zero dc field. χMT = 28.42 cm3 K mol−1 at room temperature (expected 28.34 for two isolated DyIII), falling then rising to 28.82 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, consistent with crystal-field depopulation and ferromagnetic Dy–Dy coupling. Magnetization 12.28 Nβ at 2 K and 7 T. Frequency-dependent ac susceptibility (2.5 Oe ac, 0 dc) shows slow relaxation and QTM below 4 K. Arrhenius Ueff/kB = 217.87 K, τ0 = 3.04 × 10−10 s; combined Orbach/Raman/QTM fit gives Ueff/kB = 220.1 K, τ0 = 2.86 × 10−10 s, C = 0.0024 s−1 K−n, n = 4.46. Cole–Cole α = 0.03–0.10 (5–10 K). Ab initio: ferromagnetic Dy–Dy coupling, ground-exchange gz = 38.120.",
